.* WRKSHRPOOL: the shared storage pools; their size and activity level
.* may be typed over and Enter changes them (CHGSHRPOOL). Captured on
.* the primary (tools/conformance/golden/phase12/perf/wrkshrpool*.txt).
.* BLOCKED(phase12): the primary's display is a display file on a hand grid this renderer does not make; it needs a display file with a command line
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SIZECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ACTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 6'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=IDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 4'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=PAGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=MAINSTG CLASS=SIZECL.
:VAR NAME=POOL CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SIZE CLASS=SIZECL.
:VAR NAME=ACTLVL CLASS=ACTCL.
:VAR NAME=ALLOC CLASS=SIZECL.
:VAR NAME=POOLID CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=PAGDFN CLASS=PAGCL.
:VAR NAME=PAGCUR CLASS=PAGCL.
:VAR NAME=POOLTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=WIDEST CLASS=NAMECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=POOLS VARS='POOL SIZE ACTLVL ALLOC POOLID PAGDFN PAGCUR POOLTEXT'.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/SPKEYS' NAME=SPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display text
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKSHRPOOL KEYL=SPKEYS HELP=WRKSHRPOOL ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Shared Pools
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/MAINSTG' VAR=MAINSTG USAGE=OUTPUT.Main storage size (M)
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type changes (if allowed), press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=POOLS VIEWS=2 MAXHEAD=2.
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/POOL' VAR=POOL USAGE=OUTPUT.Pool
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/SIZE' VAR=SIZE USAGE=INOUT.Defined Size (M)
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/ACTLVL' VAR=ACTLVL USAGE=INOUT.Max Active
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/ALLOC' VAR=ALLOC USAGE=OUTPUT.Allocated Size (M)
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/POOLID' VAR=POOLID USAGE=OUTPUT.Pool ID
:LISTGRP COL=PAGING.-Paging Option--
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/PAGDFN' VAR=PAGDFN USAGE=OUTPUT.Defined
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/PAGCUR' VAR=PAGCUR USAGE=OUTPUT.Current
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/POOLTEXT' VAR=POOLTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:LISTVIEW COLS='POOL SIZE ACTLVL ALLOC POOLID PAGING'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='POOL POOLTEXT'.
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKSHRPOOL.Work with Shared Pools - Help
:P.The shared storage pools: how much main storage each is given, how
many jobs may be active in it at once and the system pool number it
has while a subsystem uses it. Type a new size (in megabytes) or
activity level over a pool's and press Enter to change the pool.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/SPKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F11=Display text
:PD.Display text.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MAINSTG'.Main storage size (M)
:P.The main storage size (M) shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/POOL'.Pool
:P.The pool of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SIZE'.Defined Size (M)
:P.Type the defined Size (M) for the entry on the line.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ACTLVL'.Max Active
:P.Type the max Active for the entry on the line.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ALLOC'.Allocated Size (M)
:P.The allocated Size (M) of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/POOLID'.Pool ID
:P.The pool ID of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PAGDFN'.-Paging Option-- defined
:P.The -Paging Option-- defined of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PAGCUR'.-Paging Option-- current
:P.The -Paging Option-- current of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/POOLTEXT'.Description
:P.The description of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
